{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G2-04","example":{"issue":{"title":"鄉區斜交路口，號誌與停等空間是否清楚？","intro":"主要道路與次要道路皆約 10 m，路側緊鄰民房。","images":[{"key":"results:g2-04-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g2-04-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g2-04-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g2-04-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g2-04-photo-4","label":"現況照片 4","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"speed","title":"速限只靠標字提示","text":"路面雖有速限標字，卻缺少速限標誌。"},{"id":"signal","title":"號誌位置不易辨識","text":"路側建物與設置位置影響號誌的可視性。"},{"id":"pedestrian","title":"缺少行人停等空間","text":"路口有行人穿越需求，卻未清楚安排停等位置。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[77,78],"strategy":{"title":"先保障步行，再強化彎道路口預告","intro":"配合鄰近民房的通行需求，整理標線型人行道與號誌提示。","images":[{"key":"results:g2-04-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"walking","title":"安排連續步行空間","text":"在路側劃設標線型人行道，並配合本例30 km/h速限，降低人車混用的風險。","moduleId":"M3-01"},{"id":"warning","title":"提前預告彎道後的號誌","text":"在接近路口的轉彎路段設置注意號誌等預告，讓駕駛提早準備停等。","moduleId":"M4-01"},{"id":"direction","title":"讓允許行向容易判讀","text":"搭配道路遵行方向標誌與號誌配置，清楚提示路口的通行方向。","moduleId":"M2-03"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-2-04-signalized-rural-skewed-t.typ","sha256":"cd23524851f5874b777078dc8146acb7814bc2a00cb35658e2ec7f873c0ed33b","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g2-04-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G2-04/G2-04_現況圖_01.png","width":4116,"height":3208,"label":"G2-04 現況圖","scenario":"G2-04","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":77,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image93.png","sha256":"a5857c071a95f5c4ebd2df97ee9f8e813ef7c9365c8d9a250a8100f1f611bb83"},"results:g2-04-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G2-04/G2-04_現況照片_01.png","width":2505,"height":1409,"label":"G2-04 現況照片","scenario":"G2-04","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":78,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image96.p